        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "1 - Ashley and Jason\t\t  ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "textStyle",
                "attrs": {
                  "color": "#FFBF00"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ashley: Nice car, Jason! Is it yours?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Jason: No, it’s my sister’s. She has a new job, and she drives to work."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ashley: Is her job here in the suburbs?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Jason: No, it’s downtown."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ashley: My parents work downtown, but they don’t drive to work. They use public transportation."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Jason: The bus or the train?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ashley: The train doesn’t stop near our house, so they take the bus."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "2 - Jack and Amy   \t\t  ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "textStyle",
                "attrs": {
                  "color": "#FFBF00"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Jack: Let’s go to the park on Sunday."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Amy: Ok, but let’s go in the afternoon. I sleep late on Weekends."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Jack: What time do you get up on Sundays?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Amy: At ten o’clock."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Jack: Oh, that’s early. On Sundays, I get up at noon."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Amy: Really? Do you eat breakfast then?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Jack: Sure. I have breakfast every day."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Amy: Then let’s meet at this restaurant at one o’clock. They serve breakfast all day!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph"
      }
    ]
  }
}
